# Record with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs :  vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "owrt-tui -demo" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "5" Sleep 2s
Type "t" Sleep 1s
Type "8" Sleep 2s
Type "f" Sleep 1s
Type "?" Sleep 2s
Escape
Type "q"
